{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-e708c271324a","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-e708c271324a","name":"番茄红酱","category":"meat_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/meat_dish/%E7%95%AA%E8%8C%84%E7%BA%A2%E9%85%B1.md","blob_sha":"fbd38d64d8d67b2fc78d249cc37f627dd74086ab","details":{"introduction":"这款意式风味酱料香浓可口，蔬菜与牛肉的搭配带来丰富口感。它富含蛋白质和多种维生素，营养均衡。制作过程稍有繁琐，需要一些烹饪基础，例如炒出颗粒感的牛肉和控火慢煮。从备料到完成约需一小时，一次可多做一些冷冻保存，随取随用十分方便。","difficulty":"★★★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 碎牛肉\n- 蒜瓣\n- 胡萝卜\n- 芹菜\n- 洋葱\n- 橄榄油\n- 糖\n- 食盐\n- 胡椒粉\n- 番茄酱\n- 牛奶\n- 干罗勒或百里香（可选）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每份：\n\n- 碎牛肉 500g\n- 蒜瓣 2 个\n- 胡萝卜 半根\n- 芹菜 一根\n- 洋葱 半个\n- 橄榄油\n- 糖 2g\n- 食盐 10g\n- 黑胡椒粉 5g\n- 番茄酱 300g\n- 牛奶 300ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将胡萝卜、芹菜、洋葱切碎，蒜瓣切片。\n2. 加入 10ml 橄榄油，热油下锅蔬菜，大火翻炒开始略微变色后盛出。\n3. 锅内加油 10ml，加蒜翻炒 10 秒，加入碎牛肉、糖、盐、胡椒粉和香料将牛肉炒脆（有颗粒感）。\n4. 加入炒好的蔬菜们和番茄酱继续翻炒，搅拌均匀。\n5. 分多次缓缓倒入牛奶，中小火煮 30 分钟，完成。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- **考虑各个品牌的番茄酱内含盐量不同，建议在炒牛肉时少放盐，煮的时候尝一下再调味**\n- **煮酱料期间请搅动，以免粘锅。如果酱料变粘稠就可以出锅啦！**\n- 可根据个人口味，将碎牛肉替换成一半碎猪肉一半碎牛肉，牛奶替换成鸡汤或饮用水。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：85%瘦牛肉末400g、去皮大蒜15g、胡萝卜100g、芹菜80g、洋葱150g、大豆食用油20g、白砂糖5g、食盐5g、黑胡椒粉3g、番茄酱250g、3.25%全脂牛奶250g；整份约1000g。以大豆油替代橄榄油的标准变体，85%瘦牛肉末、全脂奶，不加可选香草。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":169.923,"protein_g":8.5673,"carbohydrate_g":11.8301,"fat_g":10.15238},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/173068/nutrients","version":"a6486860edeb90d7","fdc_ids":[173068,169230,170393,169988,170000,171411,169655,173468,170931,168556,172217]},"profile_id":"family-e708c271324a-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-e708c271324a","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-e708c271324a","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":true,"brand":null,"variant":"family-e708c271324a-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"beef_ground","grams":400},{"key":"garlic","grams":15},{"key":"carrot","grams":100},{"key":"celery","grams":80},{"key":"onion","grams":150},{"key":"oil","grams":20},{"key":"sugar","grams":5},{"key":"salt","grams":5},{"key":"black_pepper","grams":3},{"key":"ketchup","grams":250},{"key":"milk","grams":250}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"a6486860edeb90d7","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-e708c271324a-v1.405f8bccb5457b15.json","bytes":44497,"sha256":"405f8bccb5457b15cc207b438c0bdfeb260047f2dd460bb6e01e9aaf355237d9"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-e708c271324a-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-e708c271324a","recipe_blob_sha":"fbd38d64d8d67b2fc78d249cc37f627dd74086ab","version":"1","data_version":"a6486860edeb90d7","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":1000,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品1000g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：85%瘦牛肉末400g、去皮大蒜15g、胡萝卜100g、芹菜80g、洋葱150g、大豆食用油20g、白砂糖5g、食盐5g、黑胡椒粉3g、番茄酱250g、3.25%全脂牛奶250g；整份约1000g。以大豆油替代橄榄油的标准变体，85%瘦牛肉末、全脂奶，不加可选香草。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-e708c271324a","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":true